    "description": "The default keyboard is monotonous and boring\r\n\ud83c\udf3c The Flower Language Keyboard is your secret garden of expression.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 Express Yourself with Emojis\r\nSay it with a smile! Choose from our vast collection of emoji keyboards to make your conversation more interesting.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf3a Make Unique Floral Language Wallpaper\r\nDesign unique wallpapers using your floral text. Turn your meaningful messages into eye-catching wallpapers that showcase your personal style.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf3b Express Your Creativity\r\nFloral language offers a new and unique way to express yourself through the beauty of flowers. Turn your words into art and share your emotions with the world.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf37 Personalized Gifts \ud83d\udc90\r\nCreate personalized flower bouquets for your loved ones. Whether it's a birthday, anniversary, or just because, your custom bouquets will make thoughtful and memorable gifts with floral language wallpapers.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf39 Download Flower Language Keyboard today and bloom with confidence. Flower Language Keyboard: Where words meet petals to blossom emotions!",
